dOA28HsrwA&oe=69985BAB"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2024-07-26-18h03m49s591.png", "id": "454320890749453", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974790_454320894082786_707571771440452654_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kfjey0G_lIEQ7kNvwHw24Rg&_nc_oc=AdmsEAKZwxROJfFvAEKK7P-IO3iEHz2TPVRtnO5H14r6cuPfqahpJxgnYuWBdqT8IVQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv07h02OhpMAOHFXetAH5gReAZ-xz-B0YlwKUi5o_wUfg&oe=69986D30"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2024-07-26-18h06m56s734.png", "id": "1015866550329656", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031656_1015866556996322_7240666593516287157_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JdmKZQDetXkQ7kNvwGD8heb&_nc_oc=AdkmSzCL5-Pk4rplKbkQkTZJ3pUSkVaXNJsOgGGFK01VRl6UW52F3nZmv09BGAi_Vgw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuIDD6XZQ9_CieWPm8xR4l8XxFAy6pCOfXQB3kuGc-S7g&oe=6998639D"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2025-12-18-14h52m05s723.png", "id": "4185474071770816", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819417_4185474075104149_4003894709593372408_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=svypgWag_CUQ7kNvwHmkg2L&_nc_oc=AdkVuqUfgzq3VVL8fi0elLHKTcH9qXLH1naQIu7eiOH6u_ixoHPfAkMqDbHkgIxxFKA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvgczH2ohSyatDxVbVisTNC404GURVLyHngN_kWon0aAQ&oe=69984AD0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Master comp (cover_art_landscape_2560x1440)_BEHIND_vB-02 with logo.png", "id": "1320764112426735", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031450_1320764115760068_1122392115874745582_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FJG4xHCZjSUQ7kNvwEKOJih&_nc_oc=Adm5MGzKILCLT7w1rO5eLucugAMLu8Qago0Ow9dpd5BLl0-gakTW4Z3p0kPIOi5Dn44&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftVqlhrmtrmCyuc-swcYdppfsn9QshBRp8XxRwZ9Krz9w&oe=69984556"}, "display_name": "DodgeALL", "keywords": ["Action", "Dodge", "Physical", "Social", "Fitness"], "long_description": "**DodgeALL** is a high-intensity VR game that puts your agility and reflexes to the test. Engage in a world where the only rule is to dodge everything that comes your way! With immersive 3D environments and physics-based gameplay, each level presents a new challenge, offering endless replayability. Dodge, duck, dip, dive and crawl around in this adrenaline-fueled game, where your skill, speed and stamina determine your survival.\n\n# Are you ready to DodgeALL?\n\n# Features include:\n- Mixed Reality Mode: Now available via a new campaign or in Party Mode.\n- Party Mode: Play against friends & family using Android/iOS smartphones and tablets. Choose to be naughty or nice (or both). To join in, simply download the companion app \"DodgeALL Party\" for free from the app store.\n- Room-scale & 360 degrees: Where you can move in your room is where you can move in the game. No fake movement: **No VR nausea here!**\n- 3D Spatial Audio: Gives audible cues where obstacles are coming from.\n- Abilities: 5 unlockable abilities to help when things get hot.\n- Endless Mode: Play any unlocked level until you drop. Each iteration gets progressively faster.\n- Leaderboards: Compare your dodging skills to other players.\n- Twitch interactive mode: Let your viewers throw things at you!\n- Bonus levels: New crazy challenges released regularly.\n- Custom levels: Create your own levels (SideQuest required).\n\nJoin the Discord for questions, bugs, feedback or to give me ideas for new bonus levels: \nhttps://dodgeall.com/discord", "short_description": "DODGE ALL THE THINGS!!1 \n\nDodge, duck, dip, dive and crawl your way through a nonstop onslaught of obstacles coming at you everywhere you look.\n\nNow supports Mixed Reality!\n- New Mixed Reality SciFi Campaign\n- Party Mode in Mixed Reality\n\nNow supports Local Multiplayer!\n- Party Mode allows your friends with iOS/Android smartphones and tablets to interact with you using a free and easy to use app."}]}, "developer_name":